                     bishop of Aberdeen in 1350 (D. E. R. Watt, A Biographical Dictionary of
                     Scottish Graduates to A.D. 1410 (Oxford 1977), 301, 465--6).</provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Alexander de Kininmund, bishop of Aberdeen,
